2026-07-27T12:17:29.5790610Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:17:29.5791869Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:17:29.5793200Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
